---
import DocsLayout from '../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---
<DocsLayout title="友情链接" description="Z-Buddy 友情链接：宠物生态、Agent 桌宠同好与 ZCode / GLM 官方资源。">
  <h1>友情链接</h1>

  <p>宠物生态、桌宠同好与 ZCode / GLM 官方资源。</p>

  <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
    <a class="card group block transition-shadow hover:shadow-md" href="https://petdex.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <p class="font-semibold">Petdex</p>
        <span class="text-ink-2 transition-colors group-hover:text-zblue">↗</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-2">Codex 宠物分发平台，4600+ 社区宠物包。Z-Buddy 的宠物包格式与其兼容思路一致，存量宠物生态可以直接玩。</p>
      <p class="mt-3 truncate font-mono text-xs text-zblue group-hover:underline">https://petdex.dev/</p>
    </a>
    <a class="card group block transition-shadow hover:shadow-md" href="https://github.com/rullerzhou-afk/clawd-on-desk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <p class="font-semibold">clawd-on-desk</p>
        <span class="text-ink-2 transition-colors group-hover:text-zblue">↗</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-2">通用 Agent 桌宠项目，Z-Buddy 的架构参考与敬意来源。</p>
      <p class="mt-3 truncate font-mono text-xs text-zblue group-hover:underline">github.com/rullerzhou-afk/clawd-on-desk</p>
    </a>
    <a class="card group block transition-shadow hover:shadow-md" href="https://zcode.z.ai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <p class="font-semibold">ZCode</p>
        <span class="text-ink-2 transition-colors group-hover:text-zblue">↗</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-2">智谱的 AI 编程工作台，Z-Buddy 依托的编程工具——桌宠感知的就是它的 Agent 状态。</p>
      <p class="mt-3 truncate font-mono text-xs text-zblue group-hover:underline">https://zcode.z.ai/</p>
    </a>
    <a class="card group block transition-shadow hover:shadow-md" href="https://zcode.z.ai/cn/docs" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <p class="font-semibold">ZCode 文档</p>
        <span class="text-ink-2 transition-colors group-hover:text-zblue">↗</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-2">插件 / Skill / Hooks 机制官方文档。Z-Buddy 插件的能力边界都定义在这里。</p>
      <p class="mt-3 truncate font-mono text-xs text-zblue group-hover:underline">zcode.z.ai/cn/docs</p>
    </a>
    <a class="card group block transition-shadow hover:shadow-md" href="https://bigmodel.cn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <p class="font-semibold">GLM 开放平台</p>
        <span class="text-ink-2 transition-colors group-hover:text-zblue">↗</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-2">智谱大模型开放平台。Z-Buddy 规划中的聊天气泡将直连你自己的 GLM API Key。</p>
      <p class="mt-3 truncate font-mono text-xs text-zblue group-hover:underline">https://bigmodel.cn/</p>
    </a>
  </div>

  <h2 class="mt-10">想交换友链？</h2>

  <p>
    欢迎 AI 编程工具、开源桌宠、开发者工具类站点，在
    <a href="https://github.com/learnerCodeZ/Z-Buddy/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub Issues</a>
    里开个帖子附上你的站点与简介即可。只收录内容健康、与开发者生态相关的站点。
  </p>
</DocsLayout>
